WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:13.968
· An updo with your own hair only: gathered and tied at the back, the tail needs to be at least 15-20cm long — well past the shoulders — to build a full bun.

2
00:00:14.304 --> 00:00:23.592
· An updo with the help of a hairpiece: as long as the back hair can be gathered behind the neck and tied with a band — at least 5-10cm below the ears — a hairpiece lets us complete a perfect style.

3
00:00:23.928 --> 00:00:31.512
In short, just grow it long enough to tie back comfortably — and growing out your bangs along with it is the key to wedding-parent hair design.
